OL,3,GNEWSASmart glasses banned from Welsh
OL,4,AParliament after ruling they could be
OL,5,Aused for speeches
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Senedd's presiding officer has in
OL,8,Feffect banned the use of smart glasses
OL,9,Fin the Welsh Parliament, days after it
OL,10,Femerged he would allow them to be used
OL,11,Fas a teleprompter.
OL,13,FHuw Irranca-Davies had ruled that using
OL,14,Fthem in such a way was OK - provided he
OL,15,Fwas alerted first - but Members of the
OL,16,FSenedd (MS) have now been told he "will
OL,17,Fnot be considering any other requests"
OL,18,Fto use the devices.
OL,20,FReform's Jason O'Connell made headlines
OL,21,Fearlier this year after using the
OL,22,Fglasses to help him make a speech.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
