OL,3,GNEWSASmart glasses banned from Welsh
OL,4,AParliament after ruling they could be
OL,5,Aused for speeches
OL,6,
OL,7,FO'Connell, whose glasses do not include
OL,8,Fa camera, said he had voluntarily
OL,9,Fagreed not to use his device until a
OL,10,Freview into using them on the Senedd
OL,11,Festate ends.
